# <type>(<scope>): <summary>   type: feat|fix|docs|refactor|perf|test|build|ci|chore|revert
#                              summary: imperative, lower-case, no period, header <=72
# blank line, then body: why not what, wrap at 72
# blank line, then trailers (agent commits — acommit fills these):
#   Refs: <path/issue>            Advisor: <model>
#   Assisted-By: <model-slug>     Reasoning-Effort: <effort>
#   Session-Id: <id>             Co-Authored-By: <Model> <noreply@anthropic.com>
# human commit: end with a single  Human-Only: true  line instead.
